        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, Daniel Lim. Rachel Chen speaking. Are you somewhere comfortable to talk, with your papers close at hand?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Good morning, Rachel. Yes, I'm in my office. 今天家里的安排已经处理好了，现在可以安静地谈。 Business meetings have made the diary rather crowded."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you for making the time. Before we discuss your papers, please provide your identification details for the account checks."
