          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_014]] [[EV_015]] [[EV_016]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. Please take your time getting your notes ready; there is no need to rush through the paperwork."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I have the folder open now. 我习惯把家里的安排和公司的日程分开放，投资记录也想整理得更清楚。 [[EV_011]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "You mentioned your notes. I'll leave you a moment to look through the papers in front of you."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_012]] 我把旁边的背景笔记也说明一下。 [[EV_017]] [[EV_018]] [[EV_013]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_001]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Thank you. Going forward, I'll keep my working notes in a separate folder. 旧文件夹里夹着太多便条，查找起来不方便。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Okay, noted. Please allow a moment while I move the loose papers off my desk."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Certainly. [[EV_002]] [[EV_003]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_004]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_006]] [[EV_007]]"
