        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_005]] [[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "For correspondence, the secure inbox remains convenient. 我出差的时候也会看，不用让办公室的人替我转交文件。 Keeping banking correspondence separate from business messages helps me stay organised."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you for explaining your correspondence preference. Is there anything about the administrative arrangements you would like to raise before we finish?"
        },
