          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Nothing else on administration, thank you. 我要去看家里的日程了，免得和公司的会议撞在一起。 Thank you for your time today."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "You're welcome, Daniel. Thank you for calling, and enjoy the rest of your day."
